OL,3,CFlora, floats, and hydration breaks:
OL,4,CThe best pictures from Battle of
OL,5,CFlowers
OL,7,FThousands descended on Victoria Avenue
OL,8,Fin St Helier to watch the annual
OL,9,FBattle of Flowers event.
OL,11,FFrom carnival chaos to Mary Poppins,
OL,12,Fislanders put their very best ideas to
OL,13,Fflowered floats.
OL,15,FHowever, it was The Optimist Club
OL,16,Fwhich won the top prize with their
OL,17,F'Brave' float, complete with a huge
OL,18,Fgreen bagpipe towering over the crowds.
