OL,3,CFlora, floats, and hydration breaks:
OL,4,CThe best pictures from Battle of
OL,5,CFlowers
OL,7,FThis year, the event returned to
OL,8,FVictoria Avenue, following a scaled-
OL,9,Fdown version last year, which saw
OL,10,Fsmaller floral floats weave around St
OL,11,FHelier's Town Centre.
OL,13,FOne new addition to the event was
OL,14,FWorld Cup-inspired hydration breaks so
OL,15,Fperformers could pause to recover from
OL,16,Fmaximum temperatures of 27C.
